HireFerry adjusts the dark-ground palette to keep the ferry, bridge and compass
readable in its dark appearance. The original hue and surface shading are kept.
Its motion controller also exposes fractional scene seeking, and the timeline
interpolates neighboring scenes for the homepage's scroll-driven chapters.

The apple and bird are new procedural, stylized models. They are not scans,
brand logos, imported photographs, measured anatomy, or species identification.
